ke","source_id":"urn:bm:article:9df938c1-fdf7-56ea-b9b0-30cb02ce3928","url":"https://www.berlingske.dk/business/elprisen-kommer-loerdag-taet-paa-nul-kroner-efter-dyr-september"}]}],"title":"copenhagen-daily"}